      "title": "PNB: Bad Loan Auctions Will Unlock Value Through Gammon Debt Resolution",
      "body": "Analysts have reduced their price target on Punjab National Bank from about ₹129 to about ₹127, citing updated assumptions that include slightly softer revenue growth, a modestly higher discount rate, and a small improvement in projected profit margins and future P/E multiples. What's in the News The Reserve Bank of India informed Punjab National Bank that M/s P S D & Associates, Chartered Accountants, has ceased to be part of the bank's Statutory Central Auditor team with immediate effect under SEBI (LODR) disclosure rules.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
