      "title": "PNB: Bad Loan Auctions Will Unlock Value Through Gammon NPA Resolution",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on Punjab National Bank from about ₹132 to about ₹129, citing slightly adjusted assumptions for revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E, as well as a small change in the discount rate. What's in the News The Reserve Bank of India informed Punjab National Bank that M/s P S D & Associates, Chartered Accountants, has ceased to be part of the bank's Statutory Central Auditors team with immediate effect, under SEBI (LODR) disclosure rules (Regulation 30).",
