      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/banks/nse-pnb/punjab-national-bank-shares/zbk5v2ig-pnb-upcoming-leadership-transition-and-financial-review-will-shape-outlook/updates/18-the-analyst-price-target-for-punjab-national-bank-has-been-a",
