      "title": "Now 20% overvalued after recent price rise",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has risen 1.2% to ₹123. The fair value is estimated to be ₹103, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 24% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 53%. Revenue is forecast to grow by 41% in 2 years. Earnings are forecast to grow by 14% in the next 2 years.",
